# Sixteen implemented player endpoints: session GET, prepare/start/abandon/task-result/receipt;
# orient safety/check, team lobby/detail/ranking, task state/alternative submit, scoring session/sync/settle/receipt.
# Lifecycle/scoring writes are form parameters; safety and alternative submit use JSON (Spring Map conversion).
# Alternatives use SCAN/PHOTO/QUIZ and original user evidence only. No GPS/camera/upload side effects.
# Frozen alternative recovery is explicit replay of the exact retained body/key; task-state alone is not an attempt receipt.
# Frozen SYNC has no request key or receipt; low-level syncScore requires authoritative score read on unknown outcome.
